# Bilbo, Luckwearer: "Bilbo can't be blocked" and "Whenever Bilbo deals combat damage to a player, draw a card, then discard a card."
# Cast on turn 1 with two Moxen. On turn 3 Bot2's untapped Grizzly Bears (cast on turn 2) may not block him (the refusal, CR 509.1b) but Bot2's
# turn-4 attacker could be blocked... here only the refusal and the damage matter: Bilbo deals 1, Bot2 is at 19, and the trigger draws the Mountain
# and discards the Plains chosen (draw before discard: the Mountain is in hand when chosen).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Bilbo, Luckwearer
Plains
Swamp
Island
Island
Forest
Mountain
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

